适用范围 / Scope
----------------
本文件适用于本仓库中的「代码」部分，包括但不限于：scripts/ 下的全部脚本与
页面模板、index.html、dashboard/tree.html 中的页面结构 / 样式 / 脚本、
src/data/*.ts 中的类型与接口声明，以及构建与校验工具。

This file applies to the "code" portion of this repository, including but not
limited to: all scripts and page templates under scripts/, the page structure,
styles and scripts in index.html and dashboard/tree.html, the type and
interface declarations in src/data/*.ts, and the build and check tooling.

以下部分不适用本文件 / The following are NOT covered by this file:
  * 学习树内容（篇章、学习点、指引、叶子、卡片、收集箱条目及其生成 / 导出文件）
    采用 CC BY 4.0 许可，见 LICENSE-CONTENT.md。
    The learning-tree content (chapters, learning points, guides, leaves,
    cards, inbox items, and the files generated / exported from them) is
    licensed under CC BY 4.0; see LICENSE-CONTENT.md.
  * 改编自 S2AI（https://github.com/chenxiaoyu0505/S2AI）的部分，仍按 S2AI 的
    MIT License（Copyright (c) 2026 cxy）提供，见 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。
    Portions derived from S2AI remain available under S2AI's MIT License
    (Copyright (c) 2026 cxy); see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

